  "description": "Logical channels for SetNet: SendMuxAsync(channel, type, message) wraps sends in a tiny envelope and the receiver dispatches each channel on its own ordered lane — a slow flow (state dump, file chunk) no longer delays chat or input behind it (per-channel head-of-line-blocking fix). Original typed handlers fire unchanged. Depends only on SetNet.",
